♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

302
00:23:14,580 --> 00:23:15,690
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Full of Vigor]

303
00:23:15,410 --> 00:23:17,980
♪ Who made the rules? ♪

304
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:20,800
♪ Not loving is the most alluring thing ♪

305
00:23:21,020 --> 00:23:23,250
♪ It's your turn this time ♪

306
00:23:40,270 --> 00:23:40,770
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Absolutely Spectacular]

307
00:24:15,110 --> 00:24:18,140
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

308
00:24:18,650 --> 00:24:21,290
♪ This dangerous persona ♪

309
00:24:21,690 --> 00:24:24,280
♪ Please shut off your sense of
smell and sight ♪

310
00:24:24,500 --> 00:24:27,040
♪ Your hearing and touch ♪

311
00:24:27,470 --> 00:24:30,550
♪ Break out all the fake love ♪

312
00:24:31,000 --> 00:24:33,350
♪ Who made the rules? ♪

313
00:24:34,030 --> 00:24:36,430
♪ Not loving is the most alluring thing ♪

314
00:24:36,690 --> 00:24:39,390
♪ It's your turn this time ♪

315
00:24:40,070 --> 00:24:42,010
♪ It's your turn this time ♪

316
00:25:03,890 --> 00:25:06,100
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Shining Brightly]

317
00:25:06,380 --> 00:25:08,570
[Class 1, Grade 10—
Absolutely Spectacular]

318
00:25:27,780 --> 00:25:30,510
Why do I feel like
you're especially happy today?

319
00:25:30,590 --> 00:25:31,400
Of course.

320
00:25:32,150 --> 00:25:34,550
Duan Qiyan played the guitar beautifully,

321
00:25:35,480 --> 00:25:37,790
Tang Tingting's little pony was adorable,

322
00:25:37,790 --> 00:25:39,050
and most importantly,

323
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:41,820
Jin Baihui got to step onto that stage
with everyone else.

324
00:25:41,820 --> 00:25:42,780
You have no idea

325
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:44,480
how moving it was to see you all

326
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:46,340
standing there in the spotlight.

327
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,770
So do you feel any regret

328
00:25:50,310 --> 00:25:52,040
about not performing on stage?

329
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:56,580
The joy of being behind the scenes
is different.

330
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:59,050
Working bit by bit
to make the show happen,

331
00:25:59,350 --> 00:26:02,200
and then seeing you all shine on stage—

332
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:05,510
that feeling is really special.

333
00:26:10,600 --> 00:26:11,710
Let me help you.

334
00:26:11,790 --> 00:26:12,550
No need.

335
00:26:37,010 --> 00:26:44,640
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

336
00:26:45,800 --> 00:26:50,020
♪ You softly answer my quirky side ♪

337
00:26:50,410 --> 00:26:53,750
♪ Such bliss to finally be understood ♪

338
00:26:55,220 --> 00:26:58,460
♪ The moon drifts past the window ♪

339
00:26:59,980 --> 00:27:03,710
♪ How am I to understand? ♪

340
00:27:04,980 --> 00:27:06,020
♪ About you ♪

341
00:27:07,410 --> 00:27:11,630
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

342
00:27:12,420 --> 00:27:16,790
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

343
00:27:17,310 --> 00:27:20,290
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

344
00:27:20,870 --> 00:27:27,340
♪ The partiality towards me in your eyes ♪

345
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:37,000
Chunlei.

346
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,550
I feel like my voice is even hoarser now.

347
00:27:38,550 --> 00:27:40,750
I was trying so hard to hype up the crowd.

348
00:27:41,590 --> 00:27:43,830
I want bubble tea—

349
00:27:44,830 --> 00:27:45,850
the biggest size they have.

350
00:27:45,850 --> 00:27:46,400
Okay.

351
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:50,810
Tang Tingting.

352
00:27:50,810 --> 00:27:52,510
Your show wasn't bad.

353
00:27:53,070 --> 00:27:56,070
But as the lead vocalist,
you really dropped the ball.

354
00:27:56,510 --> 00:27:58,110
If it weren't for Jin Baihui,

355
00:27:58,160 --> 00:28:00,890
your performance
would've fallen apart, right?

356
00:28:01,310 --> 00:28:02,310
So what?

357
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:05,650
It's a fact that
Jin Baihui sings really well, right?

358
00:28:05,750 --> 00:28:07,410
Your show was pretty good too.

359
00:28:07,480 --> 00:28:08,720
After all, not every show

360
00:28:08,720 --> 00:28:11,320
saved time for the audience
to go to the toilet.

361
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:17,160
By the way,

362
00:28:17,550 --> 00:28:20,070
I was chatting with some students
from Experimental High the other day,

363
00:28:20,070 --> 00:28:21,310
and they told me

364
00:28:21,380 --> 00:28:22,750
some girls from their school

365
00:28:22,750 --> 00:28:24,720
had been scammed by scalpers on Tieba.

366
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:26,980
Someone from our school was scammed too.

367
00:28:28,070 --> 00:28:30,740
I think her last name was Tang.

368
00:28:32,350 --> 00:28:34,340
Didn't you go to that concert too?

369
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:35,770
Don't tell me it was you.

370
00:28:35,770 --> 00:28:36,950
Of course not.

371
00:28:38,750 --> 00:28:39,790
That's good.

372
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:43,480
I heard the tickets for that concert
were super hard to get

373
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:45,200
because there were so few available
to begin with,

374
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,730
and the perks were amazing.

375
00:28:47,350 --> 00:28:49,680
Everyone who went
got an autographed photo.

376
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:50,860
Since you went,

377
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,880
you must've gotten one too, right?

378
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:55,470
Tingting, I'm a huge fan of Han Geng too.

379
00:28:55,750 --> 00:28:56,640
Could you bring the autographed photo over

380
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,720
so I can take a look?

381
00:29:02,550 --> 00:29:03,810
Of course I have to keep

382
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:06,880
the autographed photo safely at home.

383
00:29:07,830 --> 00:29:08,960
I'll bring it to school sometime

384
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:10,240
and let you see it.

385
00:29:11,110 --> 00:29:11,920
Sure.

386
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,440
I'll be waiting then.

387
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:20,030
I have to go.

388
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:22,150
We're going to celebrate later.

389
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,240
Bye-bye.

390
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:25,270
Let's go.

391
00:29:33,550 --> 00:29:34,310
During the performance,

392
00:29:34,310 --> 00:29:36,680
I thought I was watching
my idol's concert.

393
00:29:36,680 --> 00:29:37,550
Gosh.

394
00:29:37,550 --> 00:29:39,150
I felt like I was fangirling.

395
00:29:39,510 --> 00:29:41,030
It was super cool.

396
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:42,960
Tingting, what did you say?

397
00:29:42,960 --> 00:29:44,270
I can't hear you.

398
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:53,550
Let me ask you a question.

399
00:29:56,720 --> 00:29:57,140
Shoot.

400
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:01,300
Didn't any of you notice my shoes?

401
00:30:02,010 --> 00:30:05,240
These are my new lucky shoes
I bought specially for this performance.

402
00:30:05,240 --> 00:30:07,780
I've been waiting all day and nobody's
asked me a single thing about them.

403
00:30:07,780 --> 00:30:09,860
Designer shoes, right? And?

404
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:12,660
These aren't just any
ordinary designer shoes.

405
00:30:12,750 --> 00:30:14,090
They're the reward Duan gave me

406
00:30:14,090 --> 00:30:15,750
for making it into the top 5.

407
00:30:19,350 --> 00:30:22,010
Don't you guys think his shoes
look a little too stiff?

408
00:30:22,010 --> 00:30:24,210
Why don't we all just stomp on them a bit?

409
00:30:24,530 --> 00:30:25,420
Good idea.

410
00:30:25,750 --> 00:30:27,530
You guys better not mess with these.

411
00:30:27,530 --> 00:30:29,290
This is the latest colorway.

412
00:30:29,290 --> 00:30:31,420
I had my brother snag them for me

413
00:30:31,420 --> 00:30:33,280
at retail price from a major city.

414
00:30:33,310 --> 00:30:34,550
The owner of that trendy shop

415
00:30:34,550 --> 00:30:36,440
behind our school even

416
00:30:37,030 --> 00:30:38,750
marked them up to 1,000 yuan

417
00:30:38,750 --> 00:30:39,720
just to buy these shoes from me.

418
00:30:39,720 --> 00:30:41,090
I wouldn't sell them no matter what.

419
00:30:41,090 --> 00:30:42,640
I don't even take them off when I sleep.

420
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,570
-Excuse me.
-On the back street...

421
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,910
What took you guys so long?

422
00:30:45,910 --> 00:30:46,960
Hurry up and order some food.

423
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:50,160
-See what you want to eat and drink.
-Hello, order please.

424
00:30:54,310 --> 00:30:55,240
This, and this.

425
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:58,880
Why are there glitters on your heads?

426
00:31:00,070 --> 00:31:01,110
So pretty.

427
00:31:06,070 --> 00:31:07,370
We went to return the props,

428
00:31:07,370 --> 00:31:08,880
and a box in the storage room tipped over,

429
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:11,270
so some glitter and ribbons
got stuck to us.

430
00:31:11,270 --> 00:31:12,330
Are there any left?

431
00:31:12,890 --> 00:31:14,480
Yes.

432
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:17,830
It actually looks quite romantic.

433
00:31:46,110 --> 00:31:46,830
Jiang.

434
00:31:48,590 --> 00:31:50,480
How come your little cheeks

435
00:31:50,590 --> 00:31:52,310
are flushing a bit?

436
00:31:54,290 --> 00:31:55,740
N-No, they're not.

437
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:58,160
Don't be silly. I'm just really hot.

438
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:03,200
I feel like that little smile of yours
looks a bit devious.

439
00:32:05,270 --> 00:32:06,600
Then show me your smile.

440
00:32:07,900 --> 00:32:08,440
Hehe.

441
00:32:09,840 --> 00:32:11,840
You think your smile's pretty, huh?

442
00:32:18,220 --> 00:32:19,590
When it's served, I'll eat the meat,

443
00:32:19,590 --> 00:32:20,880
and you eat the bread.

444
00:32:20,900 --> 00:32:21,510
Get lost.

445
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,720
When's your throat going to recover?

446
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:24,720
If you keep talking like that,
I'm going to die laughing.

447
00:32:24,720 --> 00:32:26,250
Don't make fun of Tingting.

448
00:32:29,030 --> 00:32:29,790
Alright.

449
00:32:29,790 --> 00:32:31,010
Everyone's here.

450
00:32:31,270 --> 00:32:32,850
Let's all raise a glass

451
00:32:32,850 --> 00:32:34,680
to celebrate
today's successful performance.

452
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:35,220
Cheers!

453
00:32:35,220 --> 00:32:35,810
Come on.

454
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:38,030
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

455
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:40,500
I'll have to stand up for this one.

456
00:32:42,740 --> 00:32:45,140
We ran into Zhao Shuran backstage earlier.

457
00:32:45,240 --> 00:32:46,810
After watching our performance,

458
00:32:46,810 --> 00:32:48,770
she was completely speechless.

459
00:32:49,310 --> 00:32:52,550
So she resorted to personal attacks
against Tingting,

460
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:54,240
saying that Tingting
had only played a pony,

461
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:55,750
had been scammed at a concert,

462
00:32:55,750 --> 00:32:56,960
and the autographed photo...

463
00:32:56,960 --> 00:32:58,360
Alright, that's enough.

464
00:32:58,550 --> 00:33:00,160
I was having such a great day.

465
00:33:00,510 --> 00:33:02,570
Just thinking about her makes me mad.

466
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:04,600
Why should you be mad?

467
00:33:05,310 --> 00:33:06,400
Our little pony

468
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:08,400
did a great job today.

469
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:11,480
You have no idea.

470
00:33:11,590 --> 00:33:13,120
When you appeared on stage,

471
00:33:13,990 --> 00:33:16,960
you took the whole atmosphere
to another level.

472
00:33:17,310 --> 00:33:19,540
You've officially inherited my legacy.

473
00:33:19,540 --> 00:33:21,480
Thank you, Tang.

474
00:33:23,350 --> 00:33:25,270
Yeah, you did a great job.

475
00:33:26,070 --> 00:33:28,270
And Jin Baihui, you sang really well.

476
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:30,960
I heard many students in the audience

477
00:33:30,960 --> 00:33:33,440
saying they were going to download
this song and listen to it at home.

478
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,160
Yeah.

479
00:33:34,330 --> 00:33:35,930
You should write more songs.

480
00:33:37,110 --> 00:33:38,090
Exactly.

481
00:33:38,750 --> 00:33:39,750
In that case,

482
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:41,720
our band will be able to debut!

483
00:33:42,180 --> 00:33:44,310
I'll pass.

484
00:33:44,900 --> 00:33:47,460
I was just letting myself be rebellious
for once on stage today.

485
00:33:47,460 --> 00:33:48,700
If my dad finds out,

486
00:33:50,350 --> 00:33:52,480
I'm going to be in for it when I get home.

487
00:33:53,880 --> 00:33:55,290
I understand what you mean.

488
00:33:55,290 --> 00:33:57,150
You'd better stop writing songs.

489
00:33:57,610 --> 00:33:58,830
Shen, do you remember

490
00:33:58,830 --> 00:34:00,830
though we only met her dad
for the first time today,

491
00:34:00,830 --> 00:34:02,690
he came in right away scolding us?

492
00:34:02,940 --> 00:34:04,180
If you write another song,

493
00:34:04,180 --> 00:34:05,090
I bet we'd both

494
00:34:05,090 --> 00:34:06,460
be accused of instigation.

495
00:34:06,460 --> 00:34:07,510
Look how cowardly he is.

496
00:34:07,510 --> 00:34:09,170
I'm not the coward here. He is.

497
00:34:09,360 --> 00:34:10,820
You're the coward.

498
00:34:12,150 --> 00:34:13,880
If it weren't for your song,

499
00:34:14,420 --> 00:34:17,820
our band wouldn't have put on
such a successful performance.

500
00:34:19,020 --> 00:34:20,940
And your song's really catchy.

501
00:34:21,600 --> 00:34:23,429
Every night when I close my eyes

502
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:25,000
to sleep,

503
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:27,880
your melodies just
keep playing in my head.

504
00:34:58,130 --> 00:34:58,880
Well,

505
00:34:59,630 --> 00:35:01,560
it's getting late. I'll get going.

506
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:03,720
You're leaving already?

507
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,590
So early?

508
00:35:08,590 --> 00:35:09,230
Your bag.

509
00:35:10,710 --> 00:35:11,510
-I'll walk you out.
-Bye-bye.

510
00:35:11,510 --> 00:35:12,020
Bye-bye.

511
00:35:12,020 --> 00:35:12,480
Bye-bye.

512
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:12,950
Bye-bye.

513
00:35:12,950 --> 00:35:14,840
-Bye-bye.
-Be careful on your way back.

514
00:35:14,840 --> 00:35:15,370
Bye-bye.

515
00:35:20,420 --> 00:35:21,130
Jin Baihui,

516
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,820
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

517
00:35:34,110 --> 00:35:35,960
I've wanted to give this to you

518
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:38,020
ever since we first started the band.

519
00:35:40,110 --> 00:35:41,070
Hope you like it.

520
00:35:44,030 --> 00:35:44,920
Lin Zhixia.

521
00:35:49,010 --> 00:35:51,690
Thank you for letting me be brave
this once.

522
00:35:52,150 --> 00:35:53,150
I don't regret it.

523
00:35:55,710 --> 00:35:57,240
You should thank yourself.

524
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:59,280
It was your choice to go on stage.

525
00:36:03,320 --> 00:36:05,150
But now that the break's over,

526
00:36:05,520 --> 00:36:08,850
I have to go back to facing
the same old routine day after day.

527
00:36:10,320 --> 00:36:13,050
Maybe life itself
is your source of inspiration.

528
00:36:14,510 --> 00:36:16,360
It's because you've experienced pain

529
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:18,420
that your lyrics carry so much power.

530
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:24,070
Actually, I revised those lyrics
several times.

531
00:36:24,070 --> 00:36:26,730
The original version
even had swear words in it.

532
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:32,810
Thank you for not singing
the original version then.

533
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:36,120
I'm heading back now.

534
00:36:36,280 --> 00:36:38,480
If I can't finish those papers tonight,

535
00:36:38,650 --> 00:36:40,850
I probably won't be able to sleep again.

536
00:36:42,280 --> 00:36:43,540
Good luck, Jin Baihui.

537
00:36:46,110 --> 00:36:46,710
Thank you.

538
00:36:58,020 --> 00:36:58,610
[Everyday To-do List]

539
00:36:58,630 --> 00:36:59,230
[Math: 30 Olympiad Problems]

540
00:36:59,250 --> 00:36:59,980
[Physics: 15 Challenging Problems]

541
00:37:00,010 --> 00:37:00,640
[Chemistry: 20 Calculation Problems]

542
00:37:00,670 --> 00:37:01,370
